  partName: Cylinder Head
  description: The Cylinder Head is a critical component located at the top-center-center
    of the rocket engine, made of a durable Cbles material, and features a complex
    shape to accommodate the engine's combustion process. It plays a crucial role
    in sealing the combustion chamber and facilitating the flow of gases. An interesting
    detail is that the Cylinder Head's large size and complex geometry require precise
    manufacturing to ensure optimal engine performance.
